# Copy to .env.local. Never commit .env.local.
#
# The publishable (anon) key is a public key — it is safe in a browser and
# RLS is what actually protects the data. It is kept out of the repo anyway,
# so that pointing a build at a database is always a deliberate act.

# The staging project's publishable key. This is the default target.
VITE_OW_SUPABASE_KEY=

# Uncomment ONLY on a deployment that is meant to write the shop's real
# books, and set the key above to the production project's.
# VITE_OW_TARGET=production
